Package: scifigexamples
Title: Scientific Publication Figure Plotting Examples with R
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Example script for a multi-panel scientific figure, and a
    dashboard app for it (app/, needs the suggested packages bslib, ragg
    and shiny). This is not an R package: the file only lists the
    dependencies, so they can be installed with pak::local_install_deps()
    and in CI.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    ggforce,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0),
    grid,
    latex2exp,
    magick,
    patchwork,
    scales,
    svglite,
    systemfonts
Suggests:
    bslib,
    ragg,
    shiny,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    vdiffr,
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
